; HomerViewGlobal.jkm -- the one HomerView key that must work anywhere
;
; Launching cannot be bound in the Edge key map, because before HomerView runs
; there is no Edge window to be focused. So this one binding belongs in the
; default key map, which applies everywhere.
;
; The installer MERGES this line into default.jkm rather than replacing the
; file, and keeps a copy of the original beside it. A user's default key map
; may hold years of their own customisation, and replacing it would be taking
; something that was not ours to take.
;
; Alt+JAWSKey+H, which is the NVDA binding with JAWS substituted for NVDA.

[Common Keys]
Alt+JAWSKey+H=launchHomerView
